WEBVTT

00:03:55.692 --> 00:04:00.603
For my little sister,
she ended up being pregnant.

00:04:00.603 --> 00:04:04.666
Today, she's only 16 years old

00:04:04.666 --> 00:04:07.662
and she has three children.

00:04:07.662 --> 00:04:11.307
Her first marriage did not survive,

00:04:11.307 --> 00:04:14.604
nor did her second marriage.

00:04:14.604 --> 00:04:18.781
On the other side, there is this girl.

00:04:19.341 --> 00:04:21.314
She's amazing.

00:04:21.314 --> 00:04:23.218
(Laughter)

00:04:23.218 --> 00:04:26.163
(Applause)

00:04:27.723 --> 00:04:30.138
I call her amazing because she is.